<title>UK: BOC sets 150 million stg June 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>BOC sets 150 million stg June 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Marksts.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BOC GROUP PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+37.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT JUNE 2002 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR AND UNSECURED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
